---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
expression: SELECT a FROM t LEFT ANTI JOIN (SELECT a FROM u WHERE a = 5) v ON t.a = v.a WHERE t.a > 1
---
Join LeftAnti, (a#0 == a#3)
:- Filter (a#0 > 1)
:  +- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#0]
+- Filter ((a#3 == 5) and (a#3 > 1))
   +- Scan spark_catalog.default.u [a#3]
